            "notes": "Round one you'll want to focus on playing with your team and not being too aggressive just yet.\n\nFor the first power, we will take [Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399). This power makes it really easy to stack up damage, especially with the boosted attack speed. After all, more swinging; more burning.  [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9) is another viable option, though I haven't tested it out enough to be able to firmly recommend it.\n\n [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) and  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) combo nicely for early game sustain, and we'll take [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) for the extra [Move Speed](stat_move_speed); helping to close gaps and secure kills.\n\nAgain, focus mostly on playing with your team and staying alive.",
