            "created_at": "2025-08-24T00:57:20.836173+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 we will take [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9) as our second power. This combos very nicely with an [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)/ [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) build. It not only helps with sustain, but it also grants us a bit of [Move Speed](stat_move_speed), which, again, can help close gaps to secure kills.\n\nFor our next item, [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is a must. This boosts survivability, [Move Speed](stat_move_speed), and [Melee Damage](stat_melee_damage). So every swing you land will make you that much stronger.\n\nOn this round, you should start noticing just how easy tank 1v1s will be. This is around the time you'll want to start playing a bit more aggressive.",
