            "notes": "With the addition of [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)  to our build, the sustain just becomes ridiculous. You are getting [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) from  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318), [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), and [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7). \n\nYou can start playing very aggressive by now. Swing on the tank until you merk them then keep holding W at the rest of their team and pummel them into the ground. For glory!",
