        {
            "id": "75a62313-fcec-4de6-aad6-9fbf0c709f72",
            "build_id": "00efba95-007c-409f-9a36-6e9c217ea6d0",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-24T00:57:20.836173+00:00",
            "notes": "Our third power will be [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5). We won't be relying too heavily on this power, as we want to keep swinging and swinging as much as we can, but it is always nice to have your shield when things get froggy. This power combos nicely with [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), as each swing will heal our shield.\n\nSpeaking of, our next item will be [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48), which takes an already ridiculously strong build and makes it THAT much stronger. This item gives a huge boost to [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed), allowing us to get even more swings off; meaning more life steal and more aggression. The difference this item will make will be immediately noticeable.\n\nThere isn't much more that needs to be said; just hold W and don't stop swinging.",
