        {
            "id": "19c03a1d-fd1e-45e6-ac98-361b7c7b97b5",
            "build_id": "00efba95-007c-409f-9a36-6e9c217ea6d0",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-24T00:57:20.836173+00:00",
            "notes": "This round [Shield Stampede](item_0c4ef690-6472-48fe-9257-864c4381f584) is very nice. It works quite well with the hyper-aggressive playstyle, as it allows you to charge in safely with your shield up. It is a good idea to take this power only after taking [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5), as it ensures that you will always have your shield available for your now upgraded charge.\n\n[Plan Z](item_8e9dc830-ad05-413a-bcc9-efc0a23d8625) is a great choice here if you went with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) or [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) last round, as it makes you swing even faster as your health goes down. The lower your health is, the faster you swing, which means you'll get more life steal as your health drops.\n\nIf you did go with  [Plan Z](item_8e9dc830-ad05-413a-bcc9-efc0a23d8625) last round though, [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) are still great picks.\n\nIf you'd rather take a simpler route, just going with [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) for the flat [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) boost is always an option.\n\nAny whom, secure that dub.\n\nFOR HONOR! FOR GLORY!",
